			<item><link target="src-packages-app-src-solid-typeexplorer-css" link="/src/app/solid/TypeExplorer.css"><text title="src/app/solid/TypeExplorer.css" code>TypeExplorer.css</></>: its look, which the Thing Explorer shares</>
			<item>Its tests: <link target="src-tests-app-src-solid-typeexplorer-test-tsx" link="/tests/app/solid/TypeExplorer.test.tsx"><text title="tests/app/solid/TypeExplorer.test.tsx" code>TypeExplorer.test.tsx</></>, <link target="src-tests-app-src-solid-typeexplorer-browser-test-tsx" link="/tests/app/solid/TypeExplorer.browser.test.tsx"><text title="tests/app/solid/TypeExplorer.browser.test.tsx" code>TypeExplorer.browser.test.tsx</></></>
			<item>Where the runners draw it: <link target="src-packages-app-src-runner-spellapprunner-tsx" link="/src/app/runner/SpellAppRunner.tsx"><text title="src/app/runner/SpellAppRunner.tsx" code>SpellAppRunner.tsx</></>, <link target="src-packages-app-src-runner-vscoderunner-tsx" link="/src/app/runner/VSCodeRunner.tsx"><text title="src/app/runner/VSCodeRunner.tsx" code>VSCodeRunner.tsx</></></>
		</>
	</>
